ar of content. Leave all content left of x835 above y350 clear.\n\nThe later layout will use the exact small one-line label MONEYBERG NEWS BRIEF in genuine Lato Black900 at35px near x118,y174, AI INVESTING and NOVEMBER13,2026 EDITION below it, and a large Lato Black900 headline AI REVENUE / DIVIDE around y360\u2013530 at80px. Two very large dollar figures and scope labels will occupy y680\u20131260 with ample dark negative space: $105B for OpenAI+Anthropic and $11B for six Chinese AI companies. Typography will be added separately with actual font files. Lato Black900 for headline/figures/labels; Georgia400 for body, estimate qualifiers and sources. Hard minimum33px for authored text,35px body,51px headline. All news text, source and any panels entirely within x104\u2013961,y164\u20131536. Do not render any of these words or figures. No red bounding rectangle. No footer, watermark or credits. Output ONLY the text-free environment, with no logos or actual coin.",
    "Refine this existing portrait AI-server editorial background ONLY, preserving its premium indigo and violet architectural style, subtle warm copper on the right, edge server racks and lower computing hardware. Produce a text-free 9:16 background intended for 1080x1920 composition. This is a background edit for a chart-based Moneyberg AI revenue news Story, not a request to render the chart or any words.\n\nKeep the central usable content region x104\u2013961 and y164\u20131536 visually quiet, dark ink-indigo. Especially provide an unobstructed, nearly uniform central area x104\u2013961,y810\u20131405 where a COMPLETE ORIGINAL source chart will be composited later at width857px and height572px. Keep texture very subtle there, without panels, frames, icons or shapes competing with the later chart. Hardware belongs at extreme left/right margins and below y1580. Preserve cinematic depth and restrained violet/copper lighting.\n\nPreserve the single small EMPTY circular copper/brass architectural medallion recess on the upper-right column, with its entire circle in frame, inner empty diameter180px near center x933,y273 on the final1080x1920 canvas. Keep it round and front facing, not elliptical. Leave the interior blank and dark. Later the exact supplied original Moneyberg gold coin PNG will be composed into this recess, uniformly scaled, with its unchanged portrait, rim lettering and full circular rim. The entire final coin is in the top75% of the canvas and clear of news content. DO NOT generate a coin, portrait, logo or lettering. The recess should have compatible contact shadow and violet/copper ambient light.\n\nAll typography is added separately later with actual font files: Lato Black900 for the small one-line MONEYBERG NEWS BRIEF brand, category/date, headline and figures; Georgia400 for body, qualifiers and source lines. Brand35px; all authored text hard minimum33px, body35px, headline51px. Keep news content inside x104\u2013961,y164\u20131536. The coming de